  "document": "David Ayer\nDavid Ayer( born January 18, 1968) is an American film director, producer and screenwriter. He wrote\" Training Day\"( 2001), co-wrote\" The Fast and the Furious\"( 2001), and directed\" Harsh Times\"( 2005),\" Street Kings\"( 2008),\" End of Watch\"( 2012),\" Sabotage\"( 2014),\" Fury\"( 2014),\" Suicide Squad\"( 2016) and\" Bright\"( 2017)."
